   "updated": 1791138187199,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Shadow deployment to validate LTV values\n• Canary at 1% of traffic, then 5%, and so on\n• 1% holdout bids without the LTV signal to measure the\n   counterfactual\n• Exploration on low LTV customers\n• Champion and challenger promotion gate",
   "originalText": "• Shadow deployment to validate LTV values\n• Canary at 1% of traffic, then 5%, and so on\n• 1% holdout bids without the LTV signal to measure the\n   counterfactual\n• Exploration on low LTV customers\n• Champion and challenger promotion gate",
