   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1791138187199,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Offline and online stores\n• Online store is a snapshot of the offline store, to reduce training and serving\n   skew\n• Holds precomputed features only; on demand features are computed at inference\n• Offline store holds the label\n• Features are versioned",
   "originalText": "• Offline and online stores\n• Online store is a snapshot of the offline store, to reduce training and serving\n   skew\n• Holds precomputed features only; on demand features are computed at inference\n• Offline store holds the label\n• Features are versioned",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 94,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
